charge.t.sol
├── given the subscription is not registered
│   └── it should revert with the {SubscriptionNotActive} error
└── given the subscription is registered
    ├── given the subscription is revoked
    │   └── it should revert with the {SubscriptionRevoked} error
    └── given the subscription is not revoked
        ├── given the cycle has already been charged
        │   └── it should revert with the {CycleAlreadyCharged} error
        └── given the cycle has not already been charged
            ├── when the cycle is out of bounds
            │   └── it should revert with the {CycleOutOfBounds} error
            └── when the cycle is within bounds
                ├── when the cycle is not due
                │   └── it should revert with the {CycleNotDue} error
                └── when the cycle is due
                    ├── given the {Space} has not approved the module for the cycle amount
                    │   └── it should revert
                    └── given the {Space} has approved the module for the cycle amount
                        ├── it should mark the cycle as charged
                        ├── it should bump the charged-cycle counter
                        ├── it should transfer the pinned amount from the {Space} to the treasury
                        ├── it should emit the {SubscriptionCharged} event
                        └── when cycles are charged out of order
                            └── it should count each charge without marking earlier cycles as charged
